        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void csmp::Accumulator&lt; dim, USER &gt;::Accumulate</definition>
        <argsstring>(double time_increment=1.)</argsstring>
        <name>Accumulate</name>
        <qualifiedname>csmp::Accumulator::Accumulate</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>double</type>
          <declname>time_increment</declname>
          <defval>1.</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>accumuates finite volume / hybride FVM _ FEM transport equation into global system </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Default sequence<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>pore volume in diagonal of LHS</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>upwinded flows coupling diagonal with off-diagonal and outgoing flows into diagonal</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>pore volume times concentration into rhs</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>sources and sinks into rhs</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Inside of the domain and for the halo stencils, accumulation by stencil is used, while truncated boundary FVs need to be accumulated finite volume by finite volume (only certain terms) </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
