    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_accumulator" kindref="compound">Accumulator</ref> Operations<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>SetupSystem()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AccumulateInteriorByFV( operator, operation )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AccumulateInteriorByFE( range )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>LateAccumulateInteriorByFV()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>LateAccumulateInteriorByFE()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AccumulatePerimeterByFV( operator, operation )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AccumulatePerimeterByFE( range )</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>LateAccumulatePerimeterByFV()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>LateAccumulatePerimeterByFE()= Attributes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>halo elements</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_accumulator" kindref="compound">Accumulator</ref> uses stencil accumulation for the interior and finite volume accumulation for its perimeter. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="attention"><para>the order in which LHS and RHS are accumulated is defined in <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_operation" kindref="compound">Operation</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
